[
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "For Ableton Live versions 5 and and later,you can follow the steps in this guide to authorize Live offline, in the following cases:",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B001",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "You cannot successfully authorize online.",
    "body_html_line": 3,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B002",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Your computer is not connected to the internet.",
    "body_html_line": 4,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B003",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "To authorize a legacy Live version 4 - 9.",
    "body_html_line": 5,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B004",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: When Live is authorized offline, Packs updates and downloads are disabled in Live's Browser.",
    "body_html_line": 7,
    "anchor": "h_01HYNFGFG9AHK3R9WH3R0CN1VA",
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B005",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
    "body_html_line": 8,
    "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B006",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "1. Install Live, following steps 1 and 2 in the guide to Installing Ableton Live.",
    "body_html_line": 9,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B007",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "2. Launch Live. In the authorization dialog that appears, choose No Internet on this computer.",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B008",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "3. The next window will display your computer's hardware code and further information regarding the offline authorization process:",
    "body_html_line": 11,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B009",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "4. Make note of the hardware code. You'll need to enter this number in your Ableton.com account. You can also press Save to export this information as a text file for later reference.",
    "body_html_line": 13,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B010",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "5. On an internet-connected computer, log in to your Ableton user account. Note that you don't necessarily need to use a second computer to authorize offline. This can be performed on the same computer, as long as it has an internet connection.",
    "body_html_line": 14,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B011",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "6. Once logged in, select your Live license from the list and click offline authorization.",
    "body_html_line": 15,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B012",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "If your license contains an upgrade, only the highest version included in your license will be shown in the dropdown menu. Select this even if you wish to authorize a previous version. For example, if your license includes both Live 11 and Live 12, the dropdown menu will display Live 12.",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B013",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "To see earlier Live versions associated with a license that has been upgraded, choose the relevant license from the dropdown menu and click View serial numbers.",
    "body_html_line": 18,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B014",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: If you purchased Live without owning earlier versions of Live and you need to authorize a previous version for compatibility with an older operating system or computer, you can contact Support for options to access previous versions.",
    "body_html_line": 20,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B015",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "7. Enter your hardware code from Live and click Download. The Ableton server will generate an authorization (.auz) file for the computer you want to authorize.",
    "body_html_line": 21,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B016",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "7a. If using an offline machine, you can save the authorization file to your portable storage device and bring it back to the computer where Live is installed.",
    "body_html_line": 23,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B017",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "8. Open Live and double click the .auz file or drag it onto the authorization dialog.",
    "body_html_line": 24,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B018",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "If you need to find your hardware code again, the offline authorization dialog can also be found in Live's Preferences > Licenses / Maintenance or Licenses & Updates tab:",
    "body_html_line": 25,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Authorizing Live offline",
        "body_html_line": 8,
        "anchor": "h_01JH3AV1VQBAT7Y30DP5CC1TMM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "OFFLINE-B019",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-OFFLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  }
]
